00:16:57,025 --> 00:16:58,385
You've got good taste.

272
00:16:59,345 --> 00:17:01,305
Here, pick what you want to watch.

273
00:17:02,905 --> 00:17:04,065
No, you choose.

274
00:18:11,385 --> 00:18:12,585
I'm bored.

275
00:18:13,545 --> 00:18:14,505
What should we watch next?

276
00:18:49,665 --> 00:18:51,785
You look so comfortable,
I can't bring myself to wake you.

277
00:18:57,985 --> 00:19:00,305
I'll even let you use my blanket.

278
00:19:01,385 --> 00:19:03,625
I don't mind
that you haven't showered yet.

279
00:19:04,505 --> 00:19:05,505
So…

280
00:19:06,945 --> 00:19:08,505
am I more likable now?

281
00:20:23,665 --> 00:20:24,825
Damn.

282
00:20:26,225 --> 00:20:27,305
I fell asleep.

283
00:20:36,265 --> 00:20:37,345
You're awake?

284
00:20:38,225 --> 00:20:39,145
Yeah.

285
00:20:41,065 --> 00:20:42,305
Hey, don't come near me.

286
00:20:42,385 --> 00:20:43,465
I haven't showered yet.

287
00:20:46,305 --> 00:20:48,385
Yeah. You really stink.

288
00:20:50,185 --> 00:20:51,545
Thought you weren't a clean freak.

289
00:20:53,665 --> 00:20:55,865
Hey, did you cook?

290
00:20:55,945 --> 00:20:57,105
Yeah.

291
00:20:58,025 --> 00:20:59,705
Wait here. I'll bring it over.

292
00:21:09,025 --> 00:21:10,665
Here. I made you a fried egg.

293
00:21:10,745 --> 00:21:12,185
Way better than your strawberries.

294
00:21:13,265 --> 00:21:15,225
Your likability score…

295
00:21:15,305 --> 00:21:16,425
I'm giving you one extra point.

296
00:21:17,305 --> 00:21:20,185
That's way too little
for all the effort I put in.

297
00:21:23,065 --> 00:21:24,545
Looks good.

298
00:21:24,625 --> 00:21:25,585
Let me brush my teeth first.

299
00:21:25,665 --> 00:21:27,585
Wait, eat first.

300
00:21:27,665 --> 00:21:29,625
It's still hot. It'll get cold.

301
00:21:30,425 --> 00:21:31,865
I made it just for you.

302
00:21:31,945 --> 00:21:32,985
Okay, okay.

303
00:21:47,025 --> 00:21:48,265
What perfume are you wearing?

304
00:21:48,865 --> 00:21:50,025
I can still smell it.

305
00:21:50,665 --> 00:21:51,865
You've got a good nose.

306
00:21:52,825 --> 00:21:53,665
Were you sniffing me?

307
00:21:59,785 --> 00:22:02,425
No. Your perfume is just really strong.

308
00:22:03,985 --> 00:22:05,265
It doesn't suit you.

309
00:22:07,105 --> 00:22:09,745
I like it. I don't wear it to please you.

310
00:22:10,665 --> 00:22:11,905
Hurry up and eat.

311
00:22:12,505 --> 00:22:14,505
Then shower and brush your teeth
so we can go to school.

312
00:22:14,585 --> 00:22:16,145
Hurry up. Forget about eating.

313
00:22:16,225 --> 00:22:17,585
We're late.

314
00:22:17,665 --> 00:22:19,585
Come on, put it down.

315
00:22:20,145 --> 00:22:21,985
Yeah, go take a shower.

316
00:22:22,665 --> 00:22:24,105
-Okay.
-Go.

317
00:22:57,985 --> 00:22:59,065
Good morning.

318
00:23:07,665 --> 00:23:08,825
Good morning.

319
00:23:24,105 --> 00:23:25,465
What are you doing here so early?

320
00:23:28,145 --> 00:23:30,145
I'm here for a surprise inspection.

321
00:23:30,225 --> 00:23:32,225
I'm seriously at my limit, Mom.

322
00:23:34,985 --> 00:23:37,345
I brought breakfast for Putter too.

323
00:23:38,385 --> 00:23:39,865
Ter's already eaten.

324
00:23:39,945 --> 00:23:41,065
I made him breakfast.

325
00:23:41,665 --> 00:23:42,665
Oh my!

326
00:23:43,785 --> 00:23:44,665
I'll start the car.

327
00:23:44,745 --> 00:23:45,745
Putter needs to go to the hospital.

328
00:23:47,785 --> 00:23:50,185
Mom! I'm your son.

329
00:23:54,145 --> 00:23:58,705
Putter, I brought a nice breakfast.

330
00:23:58,785 --> 00:23:59,985
Come eat with us.

331
00:24:00,585 --> 00:24:02,305
Thank you, Ma'am.

332
00:24:05,505 --> 00:24:06,985
Such a respectful wai.

333
00:24:07,065 --> 00:24:08,825
Such good manners.

334
00:24:08,905 --> 00:24:09,745
You're so adorable.

335
00:24:10,425 --> 00:24:11,625
That's so unfair.

336
00:24:11,705 --> 00:24:13,185
I wai just as nicely, Mom.

337
00:24:13,265 --> 00:24:15,145
It's not the same.

338
00:24:16,785 --> 00:24:18,705
Putter's kindness comes from within.

339
00:24:19,745 --> 00:24:20,745
I'm your son.

340
00:24:22,825 --> 00:24:24,945
Putter, let's go have some rice porridge.

341
00:24:25,545 --> 00:24:28,665
It looks delicious,
but I've already eaten.

342
00:24:28,745 --> 00:24:30,305
Have you had breakfast yet, Ma'am?

343
00:24:31,705 --> 00:24:33,225
Not yet, dear.

344
00:24:33,305 --> 00:24:35,305
Thanks for asking. No one ever does.

345
00:24:35,905 --> 00:24:37,545
Then let me help set the table.

346
00:24:37,625 --> 00:24:38,585
Thank you, dear.

347
00:24:38,665 --> 00:24:40,505
Oh my. I'm so touched.

348
00:24:44,865 --> 00:24:46,545
Finally, I get to sit down.

349
00:24:46,625 --> 00:24:47,585
Someone did it for me.

350
00:24:47,665 --> 00:24:49,825
Take notes from Putter, LeeIth.

351
00:24:51,865 --> 00:24:52,825
I've been sitting here the whole time.

352
00:24:52,905 --> 00:24:55,225
My own son hasn't even gotten me
a glass of water, Putter.

353
00:24:58,065 --> 00:24:59,905
Why don't you just adopt him?

354
00:25:06,745 --> 00:25:08,145
Then how about making him my son-in-law?

355
00:25:12,385 --> 00:25:14,865
I'll set Putter up with Lilly instead.

356
00:25:16,545 --> 00:25:17,745
Oh?

357
00:25:18,265 --> 00:25:19,305
Or should I set him up with you?

358
00:25:24,065 --> 00:25:25,745
Thai people will really say anything.

359
00:25:28,465 --> 00:25:31,305
Putter, how's LeeIth at school?

360
00:25:33,025 --> 00:25:36,905
LeeIth is a really great guy.

361
00:25:36,985 --> 00:25:38,425
Everyone at school likes him.

362
00:25:38,505 --> 00:25:41,065
And Ms. Aom, our homeroom teacher,

363
00:25:41,145 --> 00:25:43,025
is very fond of him.

364
00:25:43,545 --> 00:25:46,625
He's also active in school,
especially in music.

365
00:25:47,465 --> 00:25:48,425
Hmm.

366
00:25:49,465 --> 00:25:53,025
If LeeIth is serious about it,
I'll support him.

367
00:25:53,105 --> 00:25:54,425
I practice every day.

368
00:25:54,505 --> 00:25:56,785
In the morning, and again after school.

369
00:25:59,505 --> 00:26:02,705
Putter, could you send me
a video of LeeIth practicing?

370
00:26:02,785 --> 00:26:04,345
I'd like to see his progress.

371
00:26:07,785 --> 00:26:09,625
We've never recorded one.

372
00:26:09,705 --> 00:26:12,985
Didn't you say you
practice before assembly?

373
00:26:14,025 --> 00:26:16,945
-Yes.
-Then play me a song this morning.

374
00:26:17,625 --> 00:26:18,585
Go ahead.

375
00:26:18,665 --> 00:26:20,585
I want to share it with LeeIth's dad.

376
00:26:20,665 --> 00:26:21,585
Come on.

377
00:26:33,185 --> 00:26:34,545
Shit.

378
00:26:34,625 --> 00:26:35,945
It's fully booked.

379
00:26:36,025 --> 00:26:37,505
Can we switch with them?

380
00:26:41,985 --> 00:26:44,425
That's the school band
competing in Hotwave.

381
00:26:44,505 --> 00:26:46,145
No way they'd switch with you.

382
00:26:47,105 --> 00:26:48,345
What do we do?

383
00:26:50,265 --> 00:26:51,905
I ran all the way here.

384
00:26:54,945 --> 00:26:56,825
You just had to run your mouth.

385
00:26:56,905 --> 00:26:59,425
True. And you even lied to your mom.

386
00:27:00,025 --> 00:27:02,425
She said she wanted to support me.

387
00:27:03,665 --> 00:27:07,105
Oh. What about our homeroom?

388
00:27:07,825 --> 00:27:10,065
No. Too many people.

389
00:27:12,545 --> 00:27:14,665
-Hey, help me think.
-I am thinking.

390
00:27:17,425 --> 00:27:19,705
Why not use our club room?

391
00:27:20,305 --> 00:27:21,225
Good idea.

392
00:27:26,025 --> 00:27:27,305
Lazy Meow Meow.

393
00:27:27,385 --> 00:27:28,945
Meet at the club room now.

394
00:27:29,025 --> 00:27:29,985
Right now.

395
00:27:31,745 --> 00:27:33,865
Hey, I've got exam prep.

396
00:27:34,465 --> 00:27:35,945
Forget that for now.

397
00:27:41,265 --> 00:27:43,585
Damn. This is awesome.

398
00:27:43,665 --> 00:27:45,185
We totally nailed it.

399
00:27:45,265 --> 00:27:46,905
But there's one problem.

400
00:27:46,985 --> 00:27:48,065
We've never practiced.

401
00:27:48,145 --> 00:27:50,985
Since when are we called Lazy Cat?

402
00:27:51,065 --> 00:27:52,905
Lazy Meow Meow.

403
00:27:53,705 --> 00:27:54,785
Yeah, that.

404
00:27:54,865 --> 00:27:56,065
Oh, right. Guys.

405
00:27:56,145 --> 00:27:57,785
Can I ask you something?

406
00:27:58,545 --> 00:28:00,145
Please help me.

407
00:28:00,745 --> 00:28:05,265
I mean, maybe my mom will change her mind
and let me study music.

408
00:28:06,265 --> 00:28:07,225
Sure.

409
00:28:07,305 --> 00:28:09,145
-Sure, let's do it.
-We're in.

410
00:28:09,225 --> 00:28:10,145
I'm always ready.

411
00:28:10,225 --> 00:28:11,145
Indy.

412
00:28:11,665 --> 00:28:12,985
Looks like we'll have to
bring back our old songs.

413
00:28:14,185 --> 00:28:16,025
But we don't have a drummer.

414
00:28:19,305 --> 00:28:21,465
-Damn.
-Sheesh.

415
00:28:21,545 --> 00:28:22,865
I'm not messing around.

416
00:28:22,945 --> 00:28:25,145
Our group has got more than good looks.

417
00:28:25,225 --> 00:28:26,905
We're total all-rounders.

418
00:28:26,985 --> 00:28:29,585
We're all total all-rounders.

419
00:28:32,145 --> 00:28:35,025
-That's awesome.
-Hold on.

420
00:28:35,105 --> 00:28:36,825
Everyone's got an instrument.

421
00:28:36,905 --> 00:28:39,025
What about you, Tungtae?
What can you play?

422
00:28:39,105 --> 00:28:40,985
I can't play anything.

423
00:28:41,065 --> 00:28:42,665
But…

424
00:28:42,745 --> 00:28:45,185
-Right, you're the only one left.
-I can probably…

425
00:28:45,265 --> 00:28:47,025
shake this.

426
00:28:48,305 --> 00:28:50,505
-Enough, idiot. You're useful after all.
-Okay.

427
00:28:50,585 --> 00:28:51,425
-Okay.
-Got it.

428
00:28:51,505 --> 00:28:53,625
Well, it suits you.

429
00:28:55,025 --> 00:28:56,265
We're ready.

430
00:28:58,385 --> 00:28:59,625
Here we go.

431
00:29:01,065 --> 00:29:03,225
Hey. Help me out.

432
00:29:03,305 --> 00:29:04,505
Mm.

433
00:29:05,465 --> 00:29:07,625
-Sure, I'll film it.
-Thank you.

434
00:29:08,225 --> 00:29:09,185
Come on.

435
00:29:09,265 --> 00:29:10,745
-Come on!
-Ready?

436
00:29:10,825 --> 00:29:12,705
-We're ready!
-Ready.

437
00:29:12,785 --> 00:29:14,305
-Go for it!
-Everyone's ready.

438
00:29:17,625 --> 00:29:21,345
<i>Someone once told me</i>

439
00:29:21,425 --> 00:29:25,025
<i>That on the day we find love</i>

440
00:29:25,105 --> 00:29:30,385
<i>I would understand everything</i>

441
00:29:32,665 --> 00:29:36,385
<i>Then I met you</i>

442
00:29:36,465 --> 00:29:40,185
<i>And I felt this is even better</i>
<i>Than a dream</i>

443
00:29:40,265 --> 00:29:45,745
<i>It's truly wonderful</i>
<i>To have met you today</i>

444
00:29:46,745 --> 00:29:51,505
<i>The only problem is, I really don't know</i>
<i>If you feel the same way</i>

445
00:29:51,585 --> 00:29:55,265
<i>If I say it out loud, will I lose you?</i>

446
00:29:55,345 --> 00:30:00,705
<i>I'm scared that if I wait too long,</i>
<i>Someone else will win you over</i>

447
00:30:00,785 --> 00:30:05,425
<i>So today, I've decided to tell you</i>

448
00:30:05,505 --> 00:30:08,585
<i>It's just that</i>
<i>I've liked you for so long</i>

449
00:30:08,665 --> 00:30:10,705
<i>I've been in love with you for so long</i>

450
00:30:10,785 --> 00:30:13,865
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you</i>
<i>But I never have the guts</i>

451
00:30:13,945 --> 00:30:19,305
<i>I'm glad that today</i>
<i>You'll finally know that</i>

452
00:30:19,385 --> 00:30:20,905
<i>It's just that, it's just that…</i>

453
00:30:20,985 --> 00:30:22,985
What's that noise? What's going on?

454
00:30:23,065 --> 00:30:25,145
It's so loud.

455
00:30:26,505 --> 00:30:28,385
You're using the room improperly.

456
00:30:28,905 --> 00:30:32,145
You guys,
come with me to the disciplinary office.

457
00:30:32,225 --> 00:30:33,065
Come here.

458
00:30:38,345 --> 00:30:39,625
-Hurry!
-Quick…

459
00:30:41,745 --> 00:30:45,265
-Run!
-Let's go!

460
00:30:45,345 --> 00:30:48,185
Where are you going? I said stop! Stop!

461
00:30:48,265 --> 00:30:50,065
Stop! Where are you going? Stop!

462
00:31:09,025 --> 00:31:10,865
Hello. Not me.

463
00:31:38,185 --> 00:31:39,625
You can relax now.

464
00:31:39,705 --> 00:31:40,985
The teacher's gone.

465
00:31:41,065 --> 00:31:43,185
Weren't you more nervous than me?

466
00:31:44,745 --> 00:31:46,185
Your heart's racing.

467
00:31:54,985 --> 00:31:57,425
Let's go. Time for class.

468
00:32:40,145 --> 00:32:41,305
Your mom looked happy.

469
00:32:41,985 --> 00:32:43,545
She really praised your performance.

470
00:32:43,625 --> 00:32:44,505
She said you had real passion.

471
00:32:45,505 --> 00:32:46,345
Are you being sarcastic?

472
00:32:46,425 --> 00:32:48,465
No, I'm not.

473
00:32:49,065 --> 00:32:50,785
You looked really cool.

474
00:32:51,465 --> 00:32:54,265
Cooler than I expected.

475
00:32:56,425 --> 00:32:58,385
That sounded weird, but thanks.

476
00:33:01,265 --> 00:33:03,265
I like people with passion.

477
00:33:04,385 --> 00:33:06,465
They've got drive. They've got energy.

478
00:33:08,185 --> 00:33:09,185
Really?

479
00:33:09,985 --> 00:33:11,345
Am I like that?

480
00:33:11,425 --> 00:33:13,105
See for yourself if you don't believe me.

481
00:33:20,225 --> 00:33:22,185
-This?
-Yeah.

482
00:33:26,105 --> 00:33:27,385
See? Isn't it cool?

483
00:33:27,465 --> 00:33:28,625
Yeah.

484
00:33:29,265 --> 00:33:30,785
I'd like to watch you game too.

485
00:33:33,145 --> 00:33:38,625
I want to see you doing what you love.

486
00:33:50,105 --> 00:33:51,705
Time's up.

487
00:33:51,785 --> 00:33:52,905
Switch groups.

488
00:33:53,665 --> 00:33:56,225
Anyone who hasn't done the fitness test,
switch in now.

489
00:33:56,305 --> 00:33:58,385
Oh, right. It's our turn. Let's go.

490
00:34:27,385 --> 00:34:28,905
Sit wherever you like.

491
00:34:36,585 --> 00:34:38,264
I need this seat for gaming.

492
00:34:38,344 --> 00:34:39,185
Can you sit over there?

493
00:34:47,985 --> 00:34:50,505
It might be boring.

494
00:34:51,505 --> 00:34:52,784
That's okay.

495
00:34:53,304 --> 00:34:55,905
I want to watch you play.

496
00:34:56,945 --> 00:34:57,865
Okay.

497
00:35:04,425 --> 00:35:06,145
Hey, everyone. Ready for today?

498
00:35:06,225 --> 00:35:08,625
I've got a friend watching today.

499
00:35:08,705 --> 00:35:09,545
Cool?

500
00:35:09,625 --> 00:35:10,825
Hi, everyone.

501
00:35:13,985 --> 00:35:15,425
Alright, let's get started.

502
00:35:17,225 --> 00:35:19,665
I've got my shield skill. Go engage.

503
00:35:36,345 --> 00:35:37,665
Swap. Done.

504
00:35:39,465 --> 00:35:41,185
Shit, that was cool.

505
00:35:41,705 --> 00:35:43,345
I'm gonna play one more match.

506
00:35:43,425 --> 00:35:44,505
You wanna watch?

507
00:35:45,705 --> 00:35:47,225
Sure.

508
00:35:50,465 --> 00:35:51,505
Let's keep going, guys.

509
00:35:52,665 --> 00:35:54,625
One more match. It's that easy.

510
00:35:54,705 --> 00:35:55,945
Let's keep it going.

511
00:35:59,665 --> 00:36:02,265
I LIKE THIS SONG.

512
00:36:08,145 --> 00:36:09,025
Do you know Putter?

513
00:36:09,945 --> 00:36:11,825
Putter? Who?

514
00:36:12,825 --> 00:36:14,265
Oh, you don't know Putter?

515
00:36:14,785 --> 00:36:15,585
MOMELON M.4/8

516
00:36:15,665 --> 00:36:16,865
Okay, thank you.

517
00:36:17,865 --> 00:36:19,545
-You know Putter--
-You're Yihwa's friend, right?

518
00:36:20,225 --> 00:36:21,705
Sorry, I'm not free to talk.

519
00:36:21,785 --> 00:36:23,305
PADLOM M.4/1

520
00:36:34,145 --> 00:36:36,425
Can I join you guys?

521
00:36:37,785 --> 00:36:38,785
Sure.

522
00:36:38,865 --> 00:36:40,105
We've got an open spot.

523
00:36:40,185 --> 00:36:42,905
But… there aren't any guys on our team.

524
00:36:42,985 --> 00:36:45,385
That's fine. I don't mind.

525
00:36:57,185 --> 00:36:58,265
Sorry.

526
00:37:00,985 --> 00:37:02,185
Do you need something?

527
00:37:04,705 --> 00:37:06,465
You just look familiar.

528
00:37:06,545 --> 00:37:07,705
I've got one of those faces.

529
00:37:10,225 --> 00:37:11,105
You're Putter's friend, right?

530
00:37:11,185 --> 00:37:13,545
We met at orientation.

531
00:37:13,625 --> 00:37:15,585
But are we friends? I'm not sure.

532
00:37:15,665 --> 00:37:17,625
I even replied to Putter's story,

533
00:37:17,705 --> 00:37:18,945
and he never replied.

534
00:37:21,745 --> 00:37:23,025
Cut her out!

535
00:37:23,985 --> 00:37:25,025
What did you just say?

536
00:37:25,105 --> 00:37:25,905
EVE M.4/3

537
00:37:25,985 --> 00:37:26,825
Hair…

538
00:37:28,265 --> 00:37:30,385
A haircut.
I've got a haircut appointment today.

539
00:37:30,465 --> 00:37:32,025
I should get going. See you, Eve.

540
00:37:32,105 --> 00:37:33,145
-Sure, let's play again.
-Bye.

541
00:37:33,225 --> 00:37:35,705
Did those two younger guys come with you?

542
00:37:37,745 --> 00:37:40,785
They've been staring at you for a while.

543
00:37:41,385 --> 00:37:44,065
I don't think they were looking at me.

544
00:37:49,185 --> 00:37:50,065
You guys.

545
00:37:50,145 --> 00:37:50,985
Yeah?

546
00:37:51,065 --> 00:37:52,145
Ready?

547
00:37:52,225 --> 00:37:54,225
-Ready for what?
-Ready for what?

548
00:37:54,305 --> 00:37:55,145
Ready for what?

549
00:37:55,225 --> 00:37:56,465
Just be ready.

550
00:37:56,985 --> 00:37:58,945
-What?
-Hey, you two, come here.

551
00:38:00,585 --> 00:38:02,065
Hey, come on.

552
00:38:03,225 --> 00:38:04,385
Come here!

553
00:38:04,465 --> 00:38:05,665
You're so loud.

554
00:38:05,745 --> 00:38:06,985
I'll go over there.

555
00:38:07,065 --> 00:38:08,425
Why so dramatic?

556
00:38:12,825 --> 00:38:14,505
Tungtae!

557
00:38:14,585 --> 00:38:17,385
Tungtae, I really like you!

558
00:38:17,465 --> 00:38:19,265
Neo, Leo.

559
00:38:19,345 --> 00:38:20,945
Neo, the twins.

560
00:38:22,185 --> 00:38:23,785
-Putter!
-What's up?

561
00:38:23,865 --> 00:38:25,225
-I like you.
-I know.

562
00:38:25,305 --> 00:38:27,025
I really admire you.

563
00:38:27,105 --> 00:38:28,945
No, no. Sit down.

564
00:38:29,025 --> 00:38:30,465
Hand it over. Give me the form.

565
00:38:30,545 --> 00:38:31,545
-Hand it over.
-Here you go.

566
00:38:32,545 --> 00:38:34,025
-This is great!
-Yeah!

567
00:38:34,665 --> 00:38:36,585
-Can we sit here?
-Excuse us.

568
00:38:39,785 --> 00:38:40,865
Wait.

569
00:38:40,945 --> 00:38:43,545
These two middle school kids…

570
00:38:44,145 --> 00:38:45,905
-They remember us.
-They do.

571
00:38:45,985 --> 00:38:49,025
-You remember me?
-Yeah.

572
00:38:49,105 --> 00:38:52,105
They're the middle schoolers
who wanted to join our club.

573
00:38:53,225 --> 00:38:54,945
So, why do you want in?

574
00:38:55,025 --> 00:38:56,065
Go on, kid.

575
00:38:59,145 --> 00:39:00,905
-This clip. Look.
-Here.

576
00:39:00,985 --> 00:39:03,185
-Lazy Meow Meow.
-Meow Meow.

577
00:39:03,265 --> 00:39:04,985
-You were so cool.
-So cool.

578
00:39:05,665 --> 00:39:06,505
Let me see.

579
00:39:07,585 --> 00:39:08,705
He took my phone.

580
00:39:08,785 --> 00:39:10,865
Damn. It got so many likes.

581
00:39:11,465 --> 00:39:12,985
LeeIth, look.

582
00:39:13,065 --> 00:39:14,465
-Yeah.
-Let me see.

583
00:39:14,545 --> 00:39:15,585
Damn.

584
00:39:15,665 --> 00:39:17,225
How did it get this many?

585
00:39:17,305 --> 00:39:18,905
-Who posted it?
-I did.

586
00:39:19,985 --> 00:39:20,945
I posted it.

587
00:39:21,025 --> 00:39:22,945
-Really?
-I never miss good content.

588
00:39:24,745 --> 00:39:25,665
Master Tungtae.

589
00:39:25,745 --> 00:39:28,985
-You're amazing.
-You're awesome, Tungtae.

590
00:39:29,065 --> 00:39:33,985
To Yuki and me, you're our idol. My idol.

591
00:39:34,065 --> 00:39:36,545
You're the coolest boy band in school.

592
00:39:39,505 --> 00:39:40,905
I think they've lost it.

593
00:39:40,985 --> 00:39:43,505
Hey, calm down. Sit.

594
00:39:44,785 --> 00:39:46,385
We're the only band in school.

595
00:39:50,465 --> 00:39:54,505
Even if there were more bands,
you'd still be the coolest to me.

596
00:39:54,585 --> 00:39:55,625
Alright, alright.

597
00:40:01,265 --> 00:40:03,665
Okay, you two. Be honest with us.

598
00:40:04,345 --> 00:40:06,065
Why do you want to join this club?

599
00:40:06,145 --> 00:40:07,905
No hidden agenda. Just be honest.

600
00:40:07,985 --> 00:40:10,105
Sure. No problem.

601
00:40:10,185 --> 00:40:12,145
About you guys being my idols…

602
00:40:12,225 --> 00:40:14,705
I really mean that.

603
00:40:14,785 --> 00:40:16,385
But what I haven't told you is…

604
00:40:18,505 --> 00:40:19,945
I want to be popular.

605
00:40:20,025 --> 00:40:21,025
I want to be like you.

606
00:40:21,105 --> 00:40:23,745
Just like this.

607
00:40:23,825 --> 00:40:26,705
I want girls all around me.

608
00:40:27,505 --> 00:40:29,225
I want to be like you.

609
00:40:29,305 --> 00:40:30,105
A man with a goal.

610
00:40:30,185 --> 00:40:31,865
Damn, just sit down.

611
00:40:31,945 --> 00:40:34,305
That's enough. I get it.

612
00:40:34,385 --> 00:40:36,065
Give me the pen. I'll sign him up.

613
00:40:36,145 --> 00:40:37,585
-Give me the form. I'll approve.
-Really?

614
00:40:37,665 --> 00:40:38,585
-Really?
-You're the best, Bro!

615
00:40:38,665 --> 00:40:40,705
-You're the best, Bro!
-Damn!

616
00:40:40,785 --> 00:40:42,465
Bro, gimme a kiss!

617
00:40:42,545 --> 00:40:44,305
-Hey, calm down. Sit first.
-Bro!

618
00:40:44,385 --> 00:40:45,425
-The interview isn't over yet.
-Sit down.

619
00:40:45,505 --> 00:40:46,625
Yes, Sir.

620
00:40:47,225 --> 00:40:48,465
What about you?

621
00:40:48,545 --> 00:40:50,385
I want to be like you guys.
I want to be a rock star.

622
00:40:52,745 --> 00:40:54,425
-What?
-LeeIth.

623
00:40:54,505 --> 00:40:55,345
Do you see this?

624
00:40:55,425 --> 00:40:57,425
See what happens
when you're a bad role model?

625
00:40:57,505 --> 00:40:58,905
They're totally crazy.

626
00:40:59,505 --> 00:41:00,825
Aren't you a kid too?

627
00:41:02,905 --> 00:41:04,185
So, what do we do?

628
00:41:04,985 --> 00:41:06,785
-What about Yuki?
-Let him in.

629
00:41:06,865 --> 00:41:07,825
Take them both.

630
00:41:07,905 --> 00:41:09,625
-Do it.
-Let them join.

631
00:41:09,705 --> 00:41:10,825
-Come on, accept them.
-Yeah.

632
00:41:11,425 --> 00:41:12,985
Then welcome aboard.

633
00:41:13,065 --> 00:41:14,185
-Welcome.
-Welcome.

634
00:41:14,265 --> 00:41:15,905
Welcome.

635
00:41:15,985 --> 00:41:18,145
Can I finish first?

636
00:41:19,825 --> 00:41:22,345
Welcome to the Awkward Today,
Normal Tomorrow Club.

637
00:41:22,425 --> 00:41:23,985
Or, "You'll Get Used to It."

638
00:41:28,545 --> 00:41:29,865
-Shit, dude!
-Yeah!

639
00:41:29,945 --> 00:41:32,185
We've got recruits now!

640
00:41:32,265 --> 00:41:34,625
-Bro!
-Bro!

641
00:41:35,305 --> 00:41:36,185
Come on, let's go eat.

642
00:41:36,265 --> 00:41:37,665
-Bro!
-Take the juniors with us.

643
00:41:37,745 --> 00:41:38,745
I have a question.

644
00:41:38,825 --> 00:41:40,625
I'm in the club now, right?

645
00:41:40,705 --> 00:41:42,985
Can I use the club restroom?

646
00:41:43,065 --> 00:41:44,465
I really need to pee.

647
00:41:44,545 --> 00:41:45,385
Go, hurry.

648
00:41:45,465 --> 00:41:47,705
The juniors aren't shy, are they?

649
00:41:49,945 --> 00:41:51,985
It's real chaos.

650
00:41:53,785 --> 00:41:55,225
By the way, where's Indy?

651
00:41:55,305 --> 00:41:56,665
Yeah.

652
00:41:59,105 --> 00:42:00,265
Speak of the devil.

653
00:42:00,945 --> 00:42:02,985
Looks like Indy's already in tears.

654
00:42:03,065 --> 00:42:06,705
<i>Why? Why me?</i>

655
00:42:07,945 --> 00:42:12,385
-Here he comes.
<i>-I'm doomed to be just a brother</i>

656
00:42:12,465 --> 00:42:16,265
-<i>Why? Why? Why?</i>
-<i>Why? Why? Why?</i>

657
00:42:16,345 --> 00:42:17,905
-<i>Why?</i>
-<i>Why?</i>

658
00:42:18,945 --> 00:42:20,145
Excuse me.

659
00:42:20,225 --> 00:42:23,745
Sorry, this is a BBQ restaurant,
not a karaoke bar.

660
00:42:23,825 --> 00:42:25,265
That's annoying.

661
00:42:26,625 --> 00:42:27,785
I'm sorry.

662
00:42:27,865 --> 00:42:30,145
Excuse me. Could we change tables?

663
00:42:30,225 --> 00:42:31,345
Of course.

664
00:42:36,985 --> 00:42:39,465
Hey, kid. I heard you got dumped.

665
00:42:40,625 --> 00:42:42,905
Anyway, I'm sorry.

666
00:42:44,705 --> 00:42:45,665
Shall we go?

667
00:42:48,825 --> 00:42:51,185
Keep it down.
You're disturbing the other customers.

668
00:42:51,265 --> 00:42:52,665
Sorry.

669
00:42:53,865 --> 00:42:55,065
Is Indy okay?

670
00:42:55,145 --> 00:42:58,745
By the way, Faye stood you up.

671
00:42:58,825 --> 00:43:00,465
Did it really hit you that hard?

672
00:43:00,545 --> 00:43:02,105
Tell us the truth.

673
00:43:04,065 --> 00:43:06,065
He's about to. Come here.

674
00:43:06,145 --> 00:43:07,065
Hurry up.

675
00:43:08,425 --> 00:43:09,345
Alright.

676
00:43:09,865 --> 00:43:13,465
She said she cares about me,
but only as a junior.

677
00:43:16,505 --> 00:43:18,225
Let's pull an all-nighter.

678
00:43:18,305 --> 00:43:19,745
Let's keep going.

679
00:43:20,905 --> 00:43:22,265
Let's go.

680
00:43:22,345 --> 00:43:25,225
-It's hot.
-Get us some water.

681
00:43:25,305 --> 00:43:26,465
-Get some water.
-I need water. It's hot.

682
00:43:26,545 --> 00:43:28,905
-Hot water.
-Hot water?

683
00:43:28,985 --> 00:43:30,105
-Our friend's heartbroken.
-Have some ice.

684
00:43:30,185 --> 00:43:31,585
Let's do this.

685
00:43:31,665 --> 00:43:33,145
So, where are we going?

686
00:43:34,465 --> 00:43:36,145
-To LeeIth's room.
-Hey.

687
00:43:36,225 --> 00:43:37,425
I'm in.

688
00:43:38,185 --> 00:43:39,785
-Hey, wait.
-What do you think?

689
00:43:39,865 --> 00:43:41,705
Did you even ask for my consent?

690
00:43:42,745 --> 00:43:45,545
-Let's just crash here.
-Finally.

691
00:43:47,465 --> 00:43:49,065
The sound's getting out. Keep it down.

692
00:43:49,145 --> 00:43:51,425
-It's too loud.
-It's not that bad.

693
00:43:51,505 --> 00:43:53,265
-Go, go.
-LeeIth.

694
00:43:53,345 --> 00:43:54,385
Come on, do it.

695
00:43:54,465 --> 00:43:55,905
Come on, nail it!

696
00:43:55,985 --> 00:43:57,705
Won't the building manager complain?

697
00:43:57,785 --> 00:43:59,145
I stuffed the gaps with towels.

698
00:43:59,225 --> 00:44:01,105
-Try again.
-Play it right.

699
00:44:01,185 --> 00:44:02,025
The sound won't leak out.

700
00:44:02,545 --> 00:44:04,385
Go, Go!

701
00:44:04,465 --> 00:44:05,745
Hang on.

702
00:44:06,665 --> 00:44:07,705
Hey.

703
00:44:07,785 --> 00:44:08,985
Let's have red soda.

704
00:44:09,065 --> 00:44:10,305
Pour me a glass.

705
00:44:10,385 --> 00:44:12,025
-Pour your own.
-You do it.

706
00:44:12,105 --> 00:44:13,065
The snacks are here.

707
00:44:13,145 --> 00:44:13,985
Hey, hey.

708
00:44:14,065 --> 00:44:15,025
I'm having some too.

709
00:44:15,545 --> 00:44:16,905
There's this too.

710
00:44:16,985 --> 00:44:18,905
-It's here.
-It's over.

711
00:44:18,985 --> 00:44:20,865
-Wanna play?
-Stop gaming already.

712
00:44:20,945 --> 00:44:22,985
-Let's do something fun.
-I'm in.

713
00:44:23,065 --> 00:44:24,905
-Okay, give me a sec.
-Come on.

714
00:44:24,985 --> 00:44:25,985
Yeah.

715
00:44:26,065 --> 00:44:28,105
You're so done.

716
00:44:28,185 --> 00:44:29,585
The guitar.

717
00:44:30,305 --> 00:44:31,905
-Karaoke?
-Let's do it.

718
00:44:58,425 --> 00:45:00,505
-Awesome!
-Awesome, Bro!

719
00:45:00,585 --> 00:45:02,345
That was amazing, man.

720
00:45:02,425 --> 00:45:03,705
-Really?
-Yeah.

721
00:45:03,785 --> 00:45:07,105
Seriously. That was so much fun.

722
00:45:08,305 --> 00:45:09,265
My bro's totally wasted.

723
00:45:10,865 --> 00:45:13,505
But LeeIth, you've got talent.

724
00:45:15,305 --> 00:45:17,065
-Seriously.
-Honestly,

725
00:45:18,185 --> 00:45:20,105
I had a dream too.

726
00:45:21,825 --> 00:45:24,625
When I was a kid, I loved rock music.

727
00:45:25,265 --> 00:45:26,665
I wanted to be cool.

728
00:45:28,065 --> 00:45:32,305
But my mom made me think
it was just a dream or a hobby.

729
00:45:35,785 --> 00:45:39,225
LeeIth. I get you.

730
00:45:39,305 --> 00:45:42,625
When we were kids,
we wanted to play for the national team.

731
00:45:43,145 --> 00:45:46,065
Yeah. But our dad wouldn't let us play.

732
00:45:46,145 --> 00:45:47,905
So we only got to play for fun.

733
00:45:48,705 --> 00:45:49,585
Yeah.

734
00:45:53,385 --> 00:45:55,105
I feel you, Bro. I get you.

735
00:45:59,265 --> 00:46:02,985
Honestly, I wanted to be an actor.

736
00:46:03,905 --> 00:46:06,825
But it was probably beyond my abilities.

737
00:46:06,905 --> 00:46:08,025
So I started my channel.

738
00:46:08,105 --> 00:46:09,905
It's the closest I can get.

739
00:46:13,905 --> 00:46:15,905
Wow, same here.

740
00:46:20,105 --> 00:46:21,945
Almost everyone's shared. What about you?

741
00:46:23,025 --> 00:46:24,785
Skip me. I don't have a dream.

742
00:46:24,865 --> 00:46:26,665
I just want a girlfriend.

743
00:46:27,665 --> 00:46:28,785
Ouch!

744
00:46:28,865 --> 00:46:32,225
-I get it.
-But… But…

745
00:46:32,305 --> 00:46:33,825
it's already over.

746
00:46:35,305 --> 00:46:37,505
-Aw!
-Ouch!

747
00:46:37,585 --> 00:46:40,625
-That's brutal.
-I feel you.

748
00:46:41,945 --> 00:46:42,945
That got sad fast.

749
00:46:43,025 --> 00:46:46,025
Let's just go home.

750
00:46:47,145 --> 00:46:48,705
Putter, what about you?

751
00:46:54,785 --> 00:46:55,905
This is so damn stressful.

752
00:47:02,505 --> 00:47:05,025
My dream is to become an esports player.

753
00:47:06,145 --> 00:47:10,225
As for architecture,
it's a career I can actually pursue.

754
00:47:11,145 --> 00:47:12,265
And it'll make my family happy.

755
00:47:13,425 --> 00:47:17,105
But if I had to choose,
it would be esports.

756
00:47:18,505 --> 00:47:19,785
I feel you, man.

757
00:47:19,865 --> 00:47:21,425
Alright, everyone. Together.

758
00:47:25,745 --> 00:47:28,345
Come on, everyone.

759
00:47:28,425 --> 00:47:31,665
Tonight, let's have the best time.

760
00:47:32,265 --> 00:47:36,465
To our dreams,
whether they come true or not.

761
00:47:36,545 --> 00:47:37,465
Who knows?

762
00:47:38,265 --> 00:47:40,585
-Come on, everyone.
-Cheers!

763
00:47:40,665 --> 00:47:43,105
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

764
00:48:10,265 --> 00:48:12,305
You lost. I won.

765
00:48:13,625 --> 00:48:15,465
Indy, switch with me.

766
00:48:15,545 --> 00:48:16,705
You tired already?

767
00:48:16,785 --> 00:48:18,505
The weak lose.

768
00:48:18,585 --> 00:48:20,065
-Bring it on.
-Think you're so good?

769
00:48:22,905 --> 00:48:23,985
You're not playing?

770
00:48:24,665 --> 00:48:25,625
Nah.

771
00:48:31,225 --> 00:48:32,825
Here, water.

772
00:48:34,705 --> 00:48:35,785
Thanks.

773
00:48:40,145 --> 00:48:41,345
Damn.

774
00:48:41,425 --> 00:48:44,665
We didn't even drink alcohol,
and it's still a total mess.

775
00:48:44,745 --> 00:48:46,025
I can already picture it.

776
00:48:47,305 --> 00:48:50,465
After they leave,
we'll be cleaning until we drop.

777
00:48:55,145 --> 00:48:59,385
Honestly, if I lived alone,
I'd leave all the trash lying around.

778
00:49:00,185 --> 00:49:01,905
But I don't want to inconvenience you.

779
00:49:02,505 --> 00:49:03,985
Living together means making compromises.

780
00:49:06,425 --> 00:49:07,345
Am I too strict?

781
00:49:09,185 --> 00:49:10,265
No.

782
00:49:10,345 --> 00:49:12,465
You're just so tidy I feel bad.

783
00:49:13,145 --> 00:49:15,465
Hey, you lost. See?

784
00:49:15,545 --> 00:49:18,145
No cheating.
You lost, so do five push-ups.

785
00:49:18,225 --> 00:49:19,425
Cut the heartbroken guy some slack.

786
00:49:19,505 --> 00:49:22,385
-I already went easy on you.
-Hey, Junior.

787
00:49:30,865 --> 00:49:31,985
Hey.

788
00:49:33,345 --> 00:49:34,905
Have you ever had your heart
broken like Indy?

789
00:49:36,705 --> 00:49:39,305
You always ask stuff out of nowhere.

790
00:49:40,505 --> 00:49:41,465
What?

791
00:49:41,545 --> 00:49:44,305
I'm an artist. I follow my feelings.

792
00:49:44,385 --> 00:49:46,025
Yes, Mr. Artist.

793
00:49:48,065 --> 00:49:49,345
You can answer.

794
00:49:50,545 --> 00:49:51,865
I won't make fun of you.

795
00:49:54,265 --> 00:49:55,105
Never.

796
00:49:56,145 --> 00:49:57,105
But…

797
00:49:58,185 --> 00:49:59,425
I do have a crush.

798
00:50:00,585 --> 00:50:02,025
Hey, what are you two talking about?

799
00:50:02,105 --> 00:50:03,305
Nothing.

800
00:50:03,385 --> 00:50:05,065
Hey, Putter and LeeIth

801
00:50:05,145 --> 00:50:06,585
are talking about their crushes.

802
00:50:06,665 --> 00:50:07,505
Let's go hear them.

803
00:50:07,585 --> 00:50:08,985
Damn, let me hear too.

804
00:50:09,625 --> 00:50:10,825
Yeah, let me hear.

805
00:50:10,905 --> 00:50:13,625
Don't keep flirting by yourselves.

806
00:50:14,745 --> 00:50:16,705
Come on, just tell us.

807
00:50:16,785 --> 00:50:19,585
This is a safe space.

808
00:50:21,145 --> 00:50:22,105
Yeah, right.

809
00:50:22,185 --> 00:50:23,905
I don't feel safe at all.

810
00:50:25,785 --> 00:50:27,505
That stings.

811
00:50:27,585 --> 00:50:30,425
-I feel you.
-Oh, buddy.

812
00:50:30,505 --> 00:50:31,345
Wait.

813
00:50:33,185 --> 00:50:34,385
Putter.

814
00:50:35,425 --> 00:50:36,825
You can give us a hint.

815
00:50:36,905 --> 00:50:38,225
Yeah, just give us a hint.

816
00:50:38,305 --> 00:50:39,345
If you don't want to say it.

817
00:50:41,305 --> 00:50:43,145
-Tell us!
-Tell us!

818
00:50:43,225 --> 00:50:44,945
-Tell us!
-Tell us!

819
00:50:45,025 --> 00:50:47,785
-Tell us!
-Tell us!

820
00:50:51,705 --> 00:50:53,505
The person I like…

821
00:51:01,825 --> 00:51:02,665
isn't here.

822
00:51:05,265 --> 00:51:06,665
What a letdown.

823
00:51:07,185 --> 00:51:09,105
That hint was way too vague.

824
00:51:09,185 --> 00:51:11,145
It obviously wasn't anyone here.

825
00:51:13,065 --> 00:51:15,985
What? I'm open to any gender.

826
00:51:16,065 --> 00:51:18,585
It's just that my type isn't in this club.

827
00:51:21,505 --> 00:51:23,625
Yeah. True.

828
00:51:27,705 --> 00:51:28,825
Move aside.

829
00:51:30,705 --> 00:51:31,705
What?

830
00:51:38,905 --> 00:51:40,385
For the peace of this club.

831
00:51:49,265 --> 00:51:50,705
Done. Our new rule.

832
00:51:50,785 --> 00:51:53,665
No dating anyone in the club.

833
00:51:53,745 --> 00:51:55,785
Break it, and you're out.

834
00:51:58,305 --> 00:51:59,825
Then you won't end up hurt like me.

835
00:52:06,105 --> 00:52:07,345
I'm safe anyway.

836
00:52:07,425 --> 00:52:10,505
I'd never have a crush on any of you.

837
00:52:10,585 --> 00:52:12,305
-Count me in too.
-Right.

838
00:52:12,905 --> 00:52:15,185
Hey. Someone take a picture.

839
00:52:15,265 --> 00:52:16,785
I'll do it.

840
00:52:16,865 --> 00:52:18,545
-Okay.
-I set the timer for 10 seconds.

841
00:52:19,105 --> 00:52:21,065
-Come on, everyone.
-Hold on.

842
00:52:23,105 --> 00:52:24,065
Ten.

843
00:52:24,665 --> 00:52:25,985
Nine.

844
00:52:26,065 --> 00:52:27,665
-Hurry!
-Eight.

845
00:52:27,745 --> 00:52:28,865
-Seven.
-Do this pose.

846
00:52:28,945 --> 00:52:30,705
-Okay, come on.
-No heart pose!

847
00:52:30,785 --> 00:52:32,225
-Five.
-No, no!

848
00:52:32,305 --> 00:52:33,305
Four.

849
00:52:33,825 --> 00:52:34,985
-Three.
-Damn.

850
00:52:35,065 --> 00:52:35,985
Two.

851
00:52:36,065 --> 00:52:38,225
-Watch out!
-Hey!

852
00:52:44,785 --> 00:52:47,985
<i>If I were you,</i>
<i>I'd probably think you felt the same way.</i>

853
00:52:48,505 --> 00:52:49,945
<i>But I guess you don't.</i>

854
00:53:14,625 --> 00:53:16,465
<i>You guys are roommates. I don't mind that.</i>

855
00:53:16,545 --> 00:53:17,905
But you're not dating, right?

856
00:53:17,985 --> 00:53:20,385
<i>This week's club mission is helping Indy.</i>

857
00:53:20,465 --> 00:53:21,545
The love you chase slips away,

858
00:53:21,625 --> 00:53:23,825
but the love you never looked for
is right beside you.

859
00:53:23,905 --> 00:53:25,625
<i>Someone's about to confess.</i>

860
00:53:25,705 --> 00:53:27,105
<i>Don't lose to the voice in your head.</i>

861
00:53:27,185 --> 00:53:28,065
<i>I made that rule myself.</i>

862
00:53:28,145 --> 00:53:31,305
What inspired you to confess to Summer?

863
00:53:31,385 --> 00:53:33,585
<i>It may sound cliche, but…</i>

864
00:53:33,665 --> 00:53:34,745
<i>I'd regret it if I never told her.</i>

865
00:53:35,345 --> 00:53:37,505
<i>Thank you for always looking after me,</i>

866
00:53:37,585 --> 00:53:40,625
<i>caring about me,</i>
<i>and making me feel so comfortable.</i>

867
00:53:40,705 --> 00:53:42,105
<i>I want to tell you…</i>

